"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116334384181563392/fuw7j7rp?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 871}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116334384181563392/fuw7j7rp?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 242, "status": 200, "title": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "unwound_url": "https://www.orfonline.org/research/india-must-urgently-build-its-own-ai-safety-institute", "url": "https://t.co/Jd7O7AXtDo"}]}, "id": "2117240311579566164", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "From civilian applications to defence systems, #AI safety requires trusted evaluation. #India’s proposed AI Safety Institute can help build benchmarks, test models and ensure the country has a voice in shaping global AI governance: @Rudra_81 https://t.co/Jd7O7AXtDo", "url": "https://x.com/orfgeotech/status/2117240311579566164"}, {"author_id": "2514625458", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:35:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117068011190505568"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/FgGl9ha1DA", "end": 307, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GermanyInOz/status/2117068011190505568/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117067694537416704", "start": 284, "url": "https://t.co/FgGl9ha1DA"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/FgGl9ha1DA", "end": 307, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GermanyInOz/status/2117068011190505568/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117067694587686912", "start": 284, "url": "https://t.co/FgGl9ha1DA"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/FgGl9ha1DA", "end": 307, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GermanyInOz/status/2117068011190505568/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117067694524751872", "start": 284, "url": "https://t.co/FgGl9ha1DA"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/FgGl9ha1DA", "end": 307, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GermanyInOz/status/2117068011190505568/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117067694524792832", "start": 284, "url": "https://t.co/FgGl9ha1DA"}]}, "id": "2117068011190505568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "🚀 From strategy to practice: Cybersecurity exchange in Australia!\n\nIn talks with 🇦🇺 AI Safety Institute, the 🇩🇪 Information Security Office BSI explored approaches to AI evaluation &amp; secure use. They also shared 🇩🇪 experience implementing NIS2 to protect critical infrastructure. https://t.co/FgGl9ha1DA", "url": "https://x.com/GermanyInOz/status/2117068011190505568"}, {"author_id": "2002214728983326721", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:51:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117238064187908530"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4O9va7hUfa", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PolyokeyMoney/status/2117238064187908530/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117238056868810752", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/4O9va7hUfa"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4O9va7hUfa", "end": 296, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PolyokeyMoney/status/2117238064187908530/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117238056906534912", "start": 273, "url": "https://t.co/4O9va7hUfa"}]}, "id": "2117238064187908530", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🧵 Frontier AI labs are panicking over the EU AI Act audits ⚠️\n\nThe EU AI Office is investigating 30+ AI giants: OpenAI, Google, Meta, Anthropic 🤖\nThis is active enforcement, not just a consultation 🔍\n\nGPAI rules took effect August 2, 2026.\nRegulators review these items:\n✅ https://t.co/4O9va7hUfa", "url": "https://x.com/PolyokeyMoney/status/2117238064187908530"}, {"author_id": "1524014263068680192", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:36:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117325080845844768"], "id": "2117325080845844768", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "What a