 in a really tough spot right now.\n\nHyperscalers basically have two choices:\n- Host and serve Chinese open-weight models themselves\n- Rent their compute out to frontier AI labs\n\nEither way, hyperscalers price their servers after baking in massive hardware", "url": "https://x.com/jun_song/status/2116877034689638512"}, {"author_id": "1966820818140422145", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:03:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117286490699186188"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AOB8V39HG6", "end": 271, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TzviGot/status/2117286490699186188/photo/1", "media_key": "16_2117286480431210496", "start": 248, "url": "https://t.co/AOB8V39HG6"}]}, "id": "2117286490699186188", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Stop asking frontier AI companies to pause. Make refusing expensive.\nThe US should nationalize frontier AI. If Washington won’t act, the EU, Japan, Canada and Australia should block their market access.\nNo enforceable pause? No access. No revenue. https://t.co/AOB8V39HG6", "url": "https://x.com/TzviGot/status/2117286490699186188"}, {"author_id": "137203936", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:14:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117349584716361884"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 277, "start": 269, "tag": "AIWorld"}], "urls": [{"description": "Oracle brings frontier AI into the heart of enterprise computing with OpenAI to transform how organizations work.", "display_url": "social.ora.cl/6013BHvrwx", "end": 268, "expanded_url": "https://social.ora.cl/6013BHvrwx", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115134410802532352/uZ5mnC8N?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115134410802532352/uZ5mnC8N?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 245, "status": 200, "title": "Oracle Reinvents Enterprise Computing for the AI Era 